          "key": "bc7fd5437899a1868aeba789925329c30d5b6996",
          "name": "dot",
          "type": "COMPONENT_SET",
          "description": "A status indicator dot (badge) component used to communicate presence, availability, or notification count. Supports plain status dots and numeric badge variants across three sizes. PURPOSE: Communicates user presence/availability states (active, busy, inactive) or surfaces notification counts (number, number expand for 99+) as a compact visual indicator typically overlaid on avatars, icons, or list items. BEHAVIOR: Purely visual/static — no interactive behavior detected. The &#39;number expand&#39; variant automatically switches to a pill/expanded shape to accommodate overflow counts (99+). COMPOSITION: No nested component instances detected; all variants are self-contained with optional TEXT nodes for numeric content. USAGE: Use &#39;active/busy/inactive&#39; types for presence indicators on avatars or user list items. Use &#39;number&#39; type for notification badges with specific counts. Use &#39;number expand&#39; when count exceeds 99. Prefer &#39;small&#39; size for dense UIs (icon buttons, compact lists), &#39;middle&#39; for standard contexts, and &#39;large&#39; for prominent placement. CODE GENERATION NOTES: The component has an asymmetry in size coverage — &#39;busy&#39; and &#39;inactive&#39; are missing &#39;large&#39; variants in the structure (they appear only as large in the tree but small/middle also exist), so ensure all type×size combinations are handled. The &#39;number expand&#39; type renders as a pill shape rather than a circle; implement conditional border-radius logic based on type. Text nodes (&#39;number-small&#39;, &#39;number-middle&#39;, &#39;number-large&#39;, &#39;99+&#39;) should accept a dynamic label prop. Hard-coded values (12 of 19 token opportunities) suggest colors and sizing may not be fully tokenized — verify fill colors against the design token system before implementation.",
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "type": "VARIANT",
              "defaultValue": "active",
              "variantOptions": [
                "number expand",
                "active",
                "inactive",
                "busy",
                "number"
              ]
            },
            "size": {
              "type": "VARIANT",
              "defaultValue": "large",
              "variantOptions": [
                "large",
                "middle",
                "small"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
